\title{Reproducible Resources and Energy Quarterly Data}
\description{
Read, cache, validate and compare the complete Australian Resources and Energy
Quarterly history from September 2011 through June 2026.
}
\details{
\code{readreq} provides 59 audited editions: 57 with complete structured
forecast and historical workbook tables, plus audited Key macroeconomic
assumptions from the December 2011 and March 2013 reports. Readers retain
source, release, period, status, unit, missingness and content-hash provenance.

Start with \code{\link{list_req_releases}} and \code{\link{read_req}}.
}
